%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Merchant
    participant P as mobile
    participant A as Tally apps/api
    participant S as Meta Model API

    Note over M,S: PLANNED (tier 1). Tier 0 barcode is built, tier 2 on-device model is planned.
    M->>P: point camera at item
    alt barcode read (tier 0)
        P->>P: look up cached inventory → item
    else no barcode after ~600 ms, frame steady (tier 1)
        P->>P: scale to 640 px, JPEG ~80 KB
        P->>A: POST /api/businesses/:id/vision/identify [multipart, Bearer JWT]
        A->>S: muse-spark-1.3, minimal reasoning:<br/>"which of these inventory items, or none?" [cached prefix]
        S-->>A: {itemId | none, confidence}
        A-->>P: match or null
    end
    P-->>M: suggestion
    M->>P: tap to add to sale
